{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This fast paced single-player adventure platformer will test your platforming skills in 200 carefully designed hardcore levels, rewarding breaks between levels, and a cheerful BGM to help you through your endeavors. <br>Will you get to the end? <strong><i>Enter, Left, Duck, Right.</i></strong> <br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers partial controller support if STEAM INPUT is disabled.<br>Controller issues? Steam is overriding inputs (common with old games). FIX (30 seconds):</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. In Steam Library, RIGHT-CLICK [Your Game] \u2192 Properties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Click &quot;Controller&quot; tab.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Set &quot;Override for [Your Game]&quot; or &quot;Steam Input Per-Game Setting&quot; to **Disable Steam Input** (or **Forced Off**).</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1971670?t=1771343740","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1971670/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771343740","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1971670/495c8ff1b23578915acb23ad8e019e2f84bbed29/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771343740","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1971670/495c8ff1b23578915acb23ad8e019e2f84bbed29/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771343740","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"May contain mature content depicting an adult fictional character in revealing outfits not suitable for all ages."},"demos":[{"appid":4349920,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This fast paced single-player adventure platformer will test your platforming skills in 200 carefully designed hardcore levels, rewarding breaks between levels, and a cheerful BGM to help you through your endeavors. <